    -Ok $c1yA.admitted -Said ('verdict ' + $c1yA.verdict + ', decision ' + $c1yA.decision + ', exit ' + $c1yA.exit + '; the arm: ' + $c1yAArm.detail)
Add-C1yRow -Label '(a) its ONE line carries the placement''s OWN digest -- git''s blob of the bytes placed -- and its name with the dot' `
