    Check -Id 'C-1aw' -Title ($c1awCite + ': the engine was unreachable for this member''s probe (its reason below: the engine''s named pipe not among this host''s, an endpoint -- DOCKER_HOST, DOCKER_CONTEXT or the configured current context -- no listing of named pipes can see or that names no listed pipe, or no docker executable), so what engine_read does with the engine up was NOT MEASURED here; the plane row of the batch was') `
