# =============================================================================================
# BATCH-6 WP-Q -- THE EVALUATOR III: gate_present AND THE amendment-material KIND, AND THE UNDATABLE CAPTURE:
# C-1ax and C-1ay (this package's later members stand after them, ahead of this batch's END marker)
# (the BATCH-6 charter SS4, and the
# register; the operator's ruling, item (e); his later rulings, made at
# 07:2x local on this package's grounding, leans accepted)
# =============================================================================================
# THE RULINGS' WORDS, AS THE ORDERS CARRIED THEM:
#   (e) "for kind: amendment-material ONLY, gate_present reads revocation and disqualification and NOT
