# RE-POINTED AT IT: $wnBaseSha, $wnBasePins, $wnBaseDir and $wnBase are set anew below (BATCH-5's base was removed
# above, after its last member), so Invoke-WnEval -Tools base and New-WnCapture -Tools base read the cut's
# bytes, and every goal id begins G-WNQ (Invoke-WnEval's plane rule). EVERY FALSIFIER ROW IS RED AT THE TREE
